# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# All variables below are OPTIONAL.
# The skills work in draft-only mode with nothing set: they write
# titles, descriptions, hook scripts, thumbnail briefs, and community
# posts you copy into YouTube Studio yourself.
# Add a PUBLORA_API_KEY to let the skills upload and schedule the
# video you supply.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------

# Publora API key - sign up free at https://app.publora.com/signup?utm_source=github&utm_medium=env-example&utm_campaign=youtube-skills
PUBLORA_API_KEY=sk_your_key_here

# YouTube channel connection ID (format: youtube-UCxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx)
# Find this in the Publora dashboard: Channels then your YouTube channel.
# Copy the whole thing including the youtube- prefix.
YOUTUBE_PLATFORM_ID=youtube-your_channel_id_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# YouTube Data API key (optional) - with it, the insights, planner and
# title skills read a channel's recent titles, video and channel stats,
# comments and the trending list directly from Google. Without it, the
# skills fall back to asking you to paste the numbers.
#
# Free, no billing: create a project, enable "YouTube Data API v3",
# then create an API key.
#   Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/youtube.googleapis.com
#   Keys:    https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIza_your_key_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Advanced (Tier 2): if you've built your own uploader with Claude Code
# or Codex (e.g. on the YouTube Data API), set this to the command the
# skills invoke on approval. Leave unset unless you have one working.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# YOUTUBE_SKILLS_CUSTOM_POSTER=python /path/to/my-uploader.py

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pixfaro token (optional) - lets the skills generate illustrations for
# posts (feed images, carousel slides, quote-cards) and attach them on
# publish. Returns a hosted URL that flows straight into Publora media.
# Pixel-exact text/logo overlay keeps every asset on-brand.
#
# Sign up + docs: https://pixfaro.com  (key format: pf_live_...)
#
# Without a token, the skills draft the image prompt and ask you to
# generate it yourself and paste the URL.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PIXFARO_TOKEN=pf_live_your_token_here
